# Trivy suppressions for the `trivy` CI workflow (scan-type: config).
# One Trivy check ID per line, each with a justification comment above it.
# Add entries only for findings reviewed and accepted as intentional.

# CloudWatch cannot publish to an SNS topic encrypted with alias/aws/sns.
# A customer-managed key would add a monthly KMS charge for weekly alarm JSON.
AVD-AWS-0095

# Vended application Roles may manage same-namespace ClusterIP Services. Native
# admission denies ExternalName and externalIPs, and tenants cannot manage
# Endpoint/EndpointSlice objects, so this does not permit selectorless proxying.
KSV-0056
